#
#   event_loop_2 - HTML::EventLoop: updating the rendering, queueing tasks and microtasks
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/EventLoop/EventLoop.cpp (lines 302-828) with the inline
#       functions of EventLoop.h (lines 1-156): "update the rendering", queueing a task, a
#       global task and a microtask, performing a microtask checkpoint, the documents of the
#       event loop (kept in container-document order), the backup incumbent realm stack, the
#       environment settings objects whose rejected promises a checkpoint reports, the
#       same-loop windows, the idle deadline, and pausing.
